Waybar
Foot
Firefox
Zed
Dolphin
Fuzzel
Telegram
Kdenlive
LocalSend

# Style
Iosevka Nerd Fonts
Breeze Cursors
(Qt) Breeze-openSUSE Light Icons (install in /usr/share/icons/): https://store.kde.org/p/1339435/
(GTK) Modern-Office-Night-Icons: https://store.kde.org/p/2346851

# Install Official packages
sudo pacman -S $(cat package.list)

# Install Aur packages 
# NOT NECESSARY!
#paru -S $(cat aur.list)

# Copy dots
cp -r home/. /home/$USER

# UFW LocalSend rules
sudo ufw allow 53317/tcp
sudo ufw allow 53317/udp
sudo ufw reload 

Happy Linux!
